    "enUS": {
      "description": "You with the marshal? No, you don't look like it.\r\n\r\nThe rumors you've heard are only half true. Yes, we were pillaging human and dwarven camps, but we weren't doing it for the Horde. We were privately employed.\r\n\r\nI'll tell you the whole story if you buy me some grog.",
      "dialogue": {
        "229a63febe8ed49b610b": "Ah, that's the stuff. Now, where was I?",
        "bcef86916509be04ec31": "How's that drink coming?"
      },
      "summary": "Bring a Cherry Grog to Tokal, in Booty Bay, to hear the rest of her story.",
      "title": "Cherry for Your Thoughts?",
